      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769458330000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, you've reached VeloFit. My name is Charlie. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769458338266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 23520,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769458343333332
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. Could I get your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769458345333332
    },
    {
      "text": "Alex Chen. Order is 744-19B.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 23520,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769458350799998
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Alex. Let me pull that up... Okay, I see the order for the VeloPro cycling shoes. To make sure I understand, what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or a preference matter?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769458352866664
    },
    {
      "text": "They're just bad. I wore them once and got terrible blisters.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 23520,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769458366333330
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear that. I know how painful blisters can be. Just to double-check, did you have any issues getting the cleats positioned? Sometimes an odd angle can cause pressure points.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769458370599996
    },
    {
      "text": "The cleats are fine. The shoes are not. I just want a refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 23520,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769458383533329
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. Let me just check the purchase date for you. I see the delivery was 33 days ago.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769458387799995
    },
    {
      "text": "And?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 23520,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769458394066661
    },
    {
      "text": "And you are well within our 90-day return window for these cycling shoes. I can absolutely get this return started for you. I'm emailing you a pre-paid shipping label right now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769458394766661
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. So I just send them back?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 23520,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769458406766661
    },
    {
      "text": "That's right. Just pack them in the original box, attach the label, and drop it at any shipping center. Once we receive it, your full refund will be processed back to your card. Is there anything else?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769458409033327
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
